--- a/ChangeLog
+++ b/ChangeLog
@@ -1,3 +1,13 @@
+2026-10-24  Simon Peter <probonopd@users.noreply.github.com>
+
+	* Source/NSToolbarItem.m (-[GSToolbarBackView layout]): In
+	NSToolbarDisplayModeIconOnly make an item with a view as wide as
+	its view plus the insets.  The item was at least as wide as an
+	image item and as wide as its label, although neither is shown,
+	so views of the same width ended up in items of different widths
+	depending on the length of their hidden labels.
+	* Tests/gui/NSToolbarItem/iconOnlyViewWidth.m: New test.
+
 2026-09-30  Simon Peter <probonopd@users.noreply.github.com>
 
 	* Source/GSToolTips.m (-_timedOut:): Multiply the measured text size
